  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "A military helicopter, identified as a MI-17V5, crashed while deployed for firefighting operations in Central Kalimantan (Kalteng). Following search and recovery efforts hampered by adverse conditions including murky water and thick mud, the remains of all three personnel were successfully recovered. Indonesian authorities confirmed the recovery of the aircraft's flight data recorder as part of the investigation. President Prabowo Subianto officially expressed condolences regarding the fatalities. Concurrently, international cooperation has intensified, with authorities confirming the arrival of a Hercules C-130 aircraft from Australia to assist with the broader forest fire suppression efforts in the region. The survivors of the mission are scheduled for medical treatment in Jakarta and Semarang.",
